  "details": "VRChat is a fun place to socialize and it would be nice to have lots of people in the same instance. But right now if there is too many people(20+) then the game starts to lag. This is a combination between unoptimized avatars and worlds. There is a mod called Avatar Hider that disables avatars that are over a certain distance from you. This can allow someone like me who normally gets 20 frames a sec using various safety features to limit avatars in vanilla VRC to 30 frames with no safety features active with Avatar Hider. This to me is honestly the biggest sacrifice we have to make with the removal of mods as it can make the game not as fun just cause we have a large friend group.",
